{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `marr_j`, `marr_a`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: added explicit `uniform(0, 1)` prior sampling statements for `ssub`, `sad`, `rjuv`, and `rad`. These parameters are already constrained to `[0, 1]`, so these priors are density-neutral relative to the original implicit uniform priors and satisfy SafeStan's requirement that each parameter have exactly one built-in prior before likelihood use. The data file is unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int n_age;
  array[n_age + 1] int marr_j;
  array[n_age + 1] int marr_a;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0, upper=1> sjuv; // Juv. survival
  real<lower=0, upper=1> ssub; // Subad. survival
  real<lower=0, upper=1> sad; // Ad. survival
  real<lower=0, upper=1> rjuv; // Juv. recovery
  real<lower=0, upper=1> rad; // Ad. recovery
}
transformed parameters {
  simplex[n_age + 1] pr_a;
  simplex[n_age + 1] pr_j;

  // Define the cell probabilities of the juvenile m-array
  // First element
  pr_j[1] = (1 - sjuv) * rjuv;

  // Second element
  pr_j[2] = sjuv * (1 - ssub) * rad;

  // Third and further elements
  for (t in 3 : n_age) {
    pr_j[t] = sjuv * ssub * pow(sad, t - 3) * (1 - sad) * rad;
  }

  // Probability of non-recovery
  pr_j[n_age + 1] = 1 - sum(pr_j[ : n_age]);

  // Define the cell probabilities of the adult m-array
  // All elements
  for (t in 1 : n_age) {
    pr_a[t] = pow(sad, t - 1) * (1 - sad) * rad;
  }

  // Probability of non-recovery
  pr_a[n_age + 1] = 1 - sum(pr_a[ : n_age]);
}
model {
  // Priors
  sjuv ~ beta(4.2, 2.8); // Informative prior for juv. survival: Analysis A
  ssub ~ uniform(0, 1);
  sad ~ uniform(0, 1);
  rjuv ~ uniform(0, 1);
  rad ~ uniform(0, 1);

  // Define the multinomial likelihood
  marr_j ~ multinomial(pr_j);
  marr_a ~ multinomial(pr_a);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"marr_a":[3,6,2,3,2,2],"marr_j":[4,6,2,2,2,6],"n_age":5}","protected_variables":["marr_j","marr_a"]}
